### Process Text Endpoint (Direct to Phrase & Sentiment)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The customer expressed terrible service and requested a refund immediately. Overall experience was unacceptable."
}

### Process Audio Endpoint (Via Whisper, Phrase & Sentiment)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA="
}
